    "A collection of exercises — \"Beginner Reformer\", \"Post-natal Flow\"." : {
      "comment" : "A description of a program's purpose.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A few words about your teaching is enough — I'll draft a headline and studio story. It all stays on your device." : {
